  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is the focal chord of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi>P</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the ordinate of the point of intersection of the tangents at <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
